<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific Nov traffic capacity.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific Nov traffic capacity.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the latest traffic and capacity statistics for November published by Cathay Pacific Airways Limited.</p>
<p> TRAFFIC		 Oct 96	Nov 96	 Cumulative    Cumulative Percent</p>
<p>							    Jan-Nov 96   Jan-Oct 95 change</p>
<p> Pax carried	   910,520     859,070	10,005,970    9,436,055  +6.2pct</p>
<p> Freight (000kgs)     50,067	55,418	   521,201	484,493  +7.6</p>
<p> Pax load factor	 70pct     71.0pct	   73.7pct	71.4pct  +2.2</p>
<p> Cargo load factor   69.5pct     73.7pct	   66.2pct	66.4pct  -0.2</p>
<p> Number of flights     1,776	 1,820	    19,867	 18,791  +5.7</p>
<p> CAPACITY		Oct 96	Nov 96	 Cumulative   Cumulative Percent</p>
<p>							    Jan-Nov 96    Jan-Nov 95 change</p>
<p> Avail tonne-km(000)   918,744     896,029     9,210,815  8,133,936   +13.2</p>
<p> Avail seat-km(000)  4,651,252   4,611,060     9,210,815  8,133,936   +10.2</p>
<p> Revenue pax-km(000) 3,256,948   3,274,967    36,470,307 32,097,785   +13.6</p>
<p> Avail cargo(000)	441,587     451,443     4,441,722  3,806,984   +16.7</p>
<p> Cargo tonne-km(000)   307,080     332,789     2,941,221  2,529,073   +16.3</p>
